      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i been getting this really weird burning feeling in the middle of my chest lately. its like a heavy pressure too. it mostly happens when i'm walking up the stairs or doing anything active, but it goes away pretty quick if i just sit down for a minute. i think it might just be bad heartburn or something... should i just take some extra antacids to see if that helps?",
